1
00:00:00,995 --> 00:00:04,077
(Episode 15)

2
00:00:14,613 --> 00:00:15,928
Nothing has changed.

3
00:00:37,824 --> 00:00:39,609
She is in a coma.

4
00:00:40,192 --> 00:00:42,770
We're not sure at this moment
when she will wake up.

5
00:00:43,569 --> 00:00:45,945
We'll have to see how she is tonight.

6
00:00:54,322 --> 00:00:55,477
Eun Seo.

7
00:01:20,866 --> 00:01:22,013
Jun Seo.

8
00:01:30,514 --> 00:01:31,718
Jun Seo.

9
00:01:33,538 --> 00:01:37,013
Answer me.

10
00:01:40,962 --> 00:01:43,821
Jun Seo, answer me.

11
00:01:47,345 --> 00:01:48,574
Please.

12
00:01:51,802 --> 00:01:53,318
Please look at me.

13
00:02:11,841 --> 00:02:12,841
Look at this.

14
00:02:15,136 --> 00:02:16,603
She moved.

15
00:02:18,274 --> 00:02:20,079
She moved.

16
00:02:20,079 --> 00:02:21,079
What?

17
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:23,409
Thank you.

18
00:02:23,878 --> 00:02:26,623
Let me see.

19
00:02:26,623 --> 00:02:29,368
Eun Seo.

20
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,048
It's strange.

21
00:02:33,239 --> 00:02:35,451
It was moving.

22
00:02:35,451 --> 00:02:39,871
She just moved her hands.

23
00:02:41,188 --> 00:02:42,773
I swear.

24
00:02:47,227 --> 00:02:48,638
Please don't be like this.

25
00:02:50,739 --> 00:02:52,510
You have to be strong.

26
00:02:54,987 --> 00:02:57,055
Let's wait a little longer.

27
00:02:59,261 --> 00:03:00,736
She will wake up.

28
00:03:05,844 --> 00:03:07,126
Eun Seo.

29
00:03:09,341 --> 00:03:10,543
My baby.

30
00:03:11,445 --> 00:03:12,679
Eun Seo.

31
00:03:14,757 --> 00:03:19,519
Why are you breaking my heart?

32
00:03:22,910 --> 00:03:24,632
My heart is torn to pieces.

33
00:03:25,805 --> 00:03:28,871
You're breaking my heart.

34
00:03:28,871 --> 00:03:32,114
Stop it. Why are you being like this?

35
00:03:43,043 --> 00:03:46,756
I am afraid she might be
in a coma for a long time.

36
00:03:47,970 --> 00:03:50,156
What do you mean?

37
00:03:51,361 --> 00:03:54,453
Are you implying she may not wake up?

38
00:03:54,898 --> 00:03:57,920
I cannot tell you anything for sure
at this moment.

39
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:02,450
She could wake up in several hours,
or tomorrow.

40
00:04:02,450 --> 00:04:06,044
Or she might never wake up
until the last moment.

41
00:04:07,635 --> 00:04:09,283
The last moment?

42
00:04:09,283 --> 00:04:11,026
What do you mean by the "last moment?"

43
00:04:11,026 --> 00:04:12,026
Tae Seok.

44
00:04:12,859 --> 00:04:15,402
In her current condition,
even if she does wake up,

45
00:04:15,402 --> 00:04:17,388
we cannot implement
a bone marrow transplant for her.

46
00:04:17,890 --> 00:04:22,418
I mean, her cancer's still progressing
although she is in a coma,

47
00:04:22,418 --> 00:04:26,642
so she could die...

48
00:04:26,642 --> 00:04:28,494
while still in a coma.

49
00:04:29,489 --> 00:04:32,210
She could die? Did you say she could die?

50
00:04:32,210 --> 00:04:33,299
- Tae Seok.
- Say that again.

51
00:04:33,299 --> 00:04:34,713
Tae Seok, what are you doing?

52
00:04:34,713 --> 00:04:36,785
Get off of me. He said she could die.

53
00:04:36,785 --> 00:04:39,383
She's not going to die.
What are you talking about?

54
00:04:39,383 --> 00:04:41,393
How could Eun Seo die?
Why would my Eun Seo die?

55
00:04:41,393 --> 00:04:42,687
Why would my Eun Seo die?

56
00:04:42,687 --> 00:04:43,687
Tae Seok.

57
00:04:45,233 --> 00:04:47,658
Jun Seo, where are you...

58
00:04:48,673 --> 00:04:49,700
Jun Seo.

59
00:04:52,595 --> 00:04:53,608
Yoon Jun Seo.

60
00:04:57,181 --> 00:04:58,181
Where are you going?

61
00:04:59,172 --> 00:05:02,732
Eun Seo is here and dying.

62
00:05:02,732 --> 00:05:04,231
Where are you going now?

63
00:05:08,979 --> 00:05:10,143
Are you running away?

64
00:05:11,715 --> 00:05:14,366
Are you running away? Are you?

65
00:05:37,812 --> 00:05:40,010
When you said that...

66
00:05:40,010 --> 00:05:42,512
I made you laugh. It was funny, so I...

67
00:05:42,512 --> 00:05:44,043
It's open.

68
00:05:45,223 --> 00:05:47,265
I think Jun Seo is here.

69
00:05:47,265 --> 00:05:48,316
Yoon Jun Seo.

70
00:05:54,731 --> 00:05:56,452
How is she?

71
00:05:56,452 --> 00:05:57,901
When did you come, Jun Seo?

72
00:06:01,411 --> 00:06:02,411
Jun Seo.

73
00:06:04,858 --> 00:06:06,092
Have you eaten anything?

74
00:06:07,050 --> 00:06:08,252
Would you like something to eat?

75
00:06:08,962 --> 00:06:11,082
How is Eun Seo?

76
00:06:11,082 --> 00:06:13,306
Has Eun Seo woken up?

77
00:06:13,306 --> 00:06:14,964
How is Eun Seo?

78
00:06:17,952 --> 00:06:19,468
I'm not sure.

79
00:06:32,986 --> 00:06:33,986
Yes,

80
00:06:35,226 --> 00:06:37,629
I will be out of the hotel for a while.

81
00:06:37,629 --> 00:06:38,629
Yes, that's right.

82
00:06:42,302 --> 00:06:44,789
It's much more important to me
than the hotel.

83
00:06:48,238 --> 00:06:50,031
It is more important to me.

84
00:06:53,063 --> 00:06:55,404
It is more important than anything else.

85
00:06:55,404 --> 00:06:56,430
Yes.

86
00:07:36,997 --> 00:07:37,997
Hello.

87
00:07:39,221 --> 00:07:40,256
Hello.

88
00:07:45,748 --> 00:07:49,768
Are you really not coming to Eun Seo...

89
00:10:13,193 --> 00:10:16,132
Hello, Ji Hwan. It's me.

90
00:10:16,842 --> 00:10:18,388
Is Jun Seo there?

91
00:10:21,562 --> 00:10:22,562
Pardon?

92
00:10:38,244 --> 00:10:39,422
Jun Seo, no.

93
00:10:40,034 --> 00:10:41,318
Jun Seo, no.

94
00:10:45,299 --> 00:10:46,885
Don't do this.

95
00:10:46,885 --> 00:10:48,720
Don't do it, Jun Seo.

96
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,473
I'm sorry.

97
00:10:50,473 --> 00:10:52,011
I'm sorry.

98
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:55,241
You know what these are...

99
00:10:55,241 --> 00:10:57,146
You know how much these mean to you.

100
00:10:57,825 --> 00:10:59,350
Don't do this.

101
00:10:59,962 --> 00:11:01,644
I'm sorry.

102
00:11:22,529 --> 00:11:24,003
Thank you.

103
00:11:24,003 --> 00:11:25,092
Let's go to the U.S.

104
00:11:26,331 --> 00:11:27,965
Let's leave next week as planned.

105
00:11:31,187 --> 00:11:32,942
I'm getting ready for that.

106
00:11:33,683 --> 00:11:34,838
Jun Seo.

107
00:11:37,363 --> 00:11:39,212
Where do you think you're going?

108
00:11:39,923 --> 00:11:41,462
Jun Seo, look at me.

109
00:11:42,251 --> 00:11:44,059
Are you going to leave Eun Seo
lying on her sick bed?

110
00:11:44,059 --> 00:11:45,407
You knew it.

111
00:11:47,275 --> 00:11:49,158
You were going to leave
although you knew, weren't you?

112
00:11:52,058 --> 00:11:54,205
Nothing has changed.
We will go to the U.S.

113
00:11:57,749 --> 00:11:58,749
Jun Seo.

114
00:12:01,863 --> 00:12:03,020
Jun Seo.

115
00:12:04,378 --> 00:12:08,452
I'm not brazen enough
to even ask for a breakup.

116
00:12:09,825 --> 00:12:12,420
How can I possibly break up with you?

117
00:12:14,250 --> 00:12:16,190
So you will have to break up with me.

118
00:12:18,610 --> 00:12:22,797
If Eun Seo is gone, I know you can't live.

119
00:12:24,249 --> 00:12:26,314
Then I'll die, too.

120
00:12:26,314 --> 00:12:27,733
I can't live.

121
00:12:29,906 --> 00:12:31,132
So,

122
00:12:32,753 --> 00:12:34,811
you must break up with me now.

123
00:12:37,153 --> 00:12:40,854
Please leave me.

124
00:12:42,228 --> 00:12:43,228
Yes?

125
00:12:44,346 --> 00:12:45,358
Let's go to the U.S.

126
00:12:47,660 --> 00:12:49,949
If you won't go with me, I'll go alone.

127
00:12:53,923 --> 00:12:55,093
Jun Seo.

128
00:12:58,747 --> 00:12:59,894
Jun Seo.

129
00:13:02,828 --> 00:13:04,222
Jun Seo.

130
00:13:14,429 --> 00:13:16,515
- Here you are.
- Hello.

131
00:13:16,515 --> 00:13:18,282
I'm here now, so you should get some rest.

132
00:13:18,282 --> 00:13:21,246
I'm fine. You were up all night yesterday.

133
00:13:22,297 --> 00:13:23,765
I slept in the morning.

134
00:13:24,651 --> 00:13:26,721
I probably missed her so much.

135
00:13:26,721 --> 00:13:28,655
I woke up early.

136
00:13:28,655 --> 00:13:29,993
After I woke up,

137
00:13:31,782 --> 00:13:33,696
I was dying to see her.

138
00:13:34,773 --> 00:13:36,225
Please let me take care of Eun Seo.

139
00:13:38,237 --> 00:13:39,376
Sure, of course.

140
00:13:40,766 --> 00:13:42,192
Excuse me.

141
00:14:24,681 --> 00:14:27,131
How you disappoint me.

142
00:14:28,098 --> 00:14:29,690
You haven't even woken up.

143
00:14:37,976 --> 00:14:41,765
I bought lots of food items
in case you ever woke up.

144
00:14:43,825 --> 00:14:45,804
I guess I must eat them all by myself.

145
00:14:46,584 --> 00:14:47,707
Are you jealous?

146
00:14:56,361 --> 00:14:58,951
Whenever I come into your room,

147
00:15:00,437 --> 00:15:02,912
do you know what I think,
and how absurd it is?

148
00:15:06,556 --> 00:15:08,807
I imagine you're not here...

149
00:15:10,789 --> 00:15:12,609
when I open the door to see you.

150
00:15:15,948 --> 00:15:17,479
I imagine you have woken up...

151
00:15:21,037 --> 00:15:23,384
and ran away with Jun Seo again.

152
00:15:27,517 --> 00:15:30,039
It would break my heart again,

153
00:15:34,014 --> 00:15:35,539
but now...

154
00:15:38,295 --> 00:15:40,131
I think I can handle it.

155
00:15:45,777 --> 00:15:47,674
I won't try to look for you.

156
00:15:53,761 --> 00:15:55,660
I even actively hope you do that.

157
00:15:57,978 --> 00:15:59,061
Could you?

158
00:16:29,889 --> 00:16:31,070
Please.

159
00:16:32,667 --> 00:16:34,629
There's no one but you, Tae Seok.

160
00:16:35,931 --> 00:16:37,656
Please make Jun Seo stop.

161
00:16:38,851 --> 00:16:41,957
He would listen to you.

162
00:16:43,306 --> 00:16:47,157
Is he going to leave for the U.S.?

163
00:16:47,748 --> 00:16:48,997
He said he was going to.

164
00:16:50,331 --> 00:16:53,814
He said he would leave for the U.S.
and stop painting.

165
00:16:53,814 --> 00:16:55,410
That is not like Jun Seo.

166
00:16:56,411 --> 00:16:58,804
He can't do that. He's not himself.

167
00:16:58,804 --> 00:17:01,909
Who is in their right mind now?

168
00:17:01,909 --> 00:17:03,954
What if Jun Seo gave up?

169
00:17:04,598 --> 00:17:07,002
What if he gave up on everything?

170
00:17:08,919 --> 00:17:09,969
Tae Seok.

171
00:17:12,543 --> 00:17:14,241
If that's what he wants, let him be.

172
00:17:15,607 --> 00:17:17,050
Why is he giving up...

173
00:17:18,542 --> 00:17:20,603
when Eun Seo hasn't given up?

174
00:17:22,255 --> 00:17:23,471
Who does he think he is?

175
00:17:26,184 --> 00:17:27,546
Tae Seok, please.

176
00:17:29,934 --> 00:17:34,225
You're his best friend.

177
00:17:35,279 --> 00:17:38,034
I know you care for Jun Seo
more than anyone.

178
00:17:38,879 --> 00:17:40,299
What do you want from me?

179
00:17:41,894 --> 00:17:43,466
I don't want anything anymore.

180
00:17:45,639 --> 00:17:48,417
I think there are things we can't control,
no matter how hard we try.

181
00:17:49,576 --> 00:17:51,339
Like Jun Seo and Eun Seo.

182
00:17:51,339 --> 00:17:52,492
Shin Yu Mi.

183
00:17:54,827 --> 00:17:56,200
Why are you, of all people, doing this?

184
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,689
Why are you being so cruel?

185
00:17:59,150 --> 00:18:00,995
Do you want me to drag him...

186
00:18:03,592 --> 00:18:05,292
and take him to Eun Seo?

187
00:18:07,031 --> 00:18:08,866
Even if Eun Seo is in that condition,

188
00:18:11,672 --> 00:18:12,919
how could I...

189
00:18:15,788 --> 00:18:18,014
take Jun Seo to Eun Seo?

190
00:18:22,357 --> 00:18:23,357
No.

191
00:18:25,238 --> 00:18:26,496
I can't do that.

192
00:18:29,923 --> 00:18:30,923
I won't do that.

193
00:18:35,531 --> 00:18:36,590
I am...

194
00:18:40,354 --> 00:18:42,229
the last man for Eun Seo.

195
00:19:13,878 --> 00:19:14,878
Sin Ae.

196
00:19:17,799 --> 00:19:19,642
Sin Ae.

197
00:19:20,014 --> 00:19:21,946
What are you doing here?

198
00:19:25,030 --> 00:19:26,073
Sin Ae.

199
00:19:28,246 --> 00:19:29,424
Mom.

200
00:19:35,063 --> 00:19:36,754
Did you see Eun Seo?

201
00:19:40,039 --> 00:19:41,039
Sin Ae.

202
00:19:41,894 --> 00:19:43,330
Has Jun Seo come?

203
00:19:46,422 --> 00:19:49,777
Go to Jun Seo. Check on how he's doing.

204
00:19:51,519 --> 00:19:53,717
And tell him to come here.

205
00:19:53,717 --> 00:19:56,049
Why is he not coming?

206
00:19:56,049 --> 00:19:58,101
Eun Seo is probably waiting for him.

207
00:19:59,899 --> 00:20:03,254
I think I can understand him.

208
00:20:05,194 --> 00:20:07,046
I don't want to see Eun Seo, either.

209
00:20:08,017 --> 00:20:09,017
Sin Ae.

210
00:20:09,497 --> 00:20:12,652
I think I'm the one
who should've had cancer.

211
00:20:13,764 --> 00:20:15,017
I have always had this feeling.

212
00:20:15,812 --> 00:20:18,870
I always don't feel right that
we got switched.

213
00:20:20,636 --> 00:20:22,815
It was like I took everything
that belonged to her.

214
00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:27,863
Why does she have cancer?

215
00:20:36,103 --> 00:20:38,327
We shouldn't have gotten switched.

216
00:20:40,723 --> 00:20:43,104
In that case, would I have had cancer?

217
00:20:45,371 --> 00:20:47,415
I keep thinking about that.

218
00:20:49,221 --> 00:20:51,215
It's a terrible thing to think that.

219
00:20:52,484 --> 00:20:53,950
That's terrible.

220
00:20:55,236 --> 00:20:57,199
You can't be like this as well, I...

221
00:21:01,005 --> 00:21:05,761
Sin Ae, is Eun Seo going to wake up?

222
00:21:05,761 --> 00:21:08,779
Of course, Mom.

223
00:21:08,779 --> 00:21:10,549
You know how strong Eun Seo is.

224
00:21:13,106 --> 00:21:15,593
Right.

225
00:21:58,960 --> 00:22:01,124
You have such small hands.

226
00:22:02,434 --> 00:22:04,435
Your hands look like mine.

227
00:22:09,488 --> 00:22:12,925
You shouldn't have taken after
your dad's fate, but mine.

228
00:22:14,320 --> 00:22:18,819
Then you wouldn't have had cancer.

229
00:22:25,513 --> 00:22:26,513
No.

230
00:22:29,281 --> 00:22:30,357
That's not all true.

231
00:22:32,264 --> 00:22:33,338
Right.

232
00:22:35,058 --> 00:22:36,876
You have taken after some of my fate, too.

233
00:22:41,088 --> 00:22:42,940
That is why...

234
00:22:45,594 --> 00:22:49,563
your life has been so unfortunate.

235
00:23:18,361 --> 00:23:22,577
What do you want to be
if you were to be born again?

236
00:23:23,269 --> 00:23:24,549
What about you?

237
00:23:24,549 --> 00:23:25,936
I want to be...

238
00:23:28,366 --> 00:23:29,640
I will be a tree.

239
00:23:31,654 --> 00:23:32,694
A tree?

240
00:23:32,694 --> 00:23:34,208
Yes, a tree.

241
00:23:34,862 --> 00:23:36,829
Once it has taken root,

242
00:23:36,829 --> 00:23:39,168
it can't move anywhere else.
I want to be such a tree.

243
00:23:40,421 --> 00:23:45,696
Then I won't have to part with anyone
ever again.

244
00:24:22,648 --> 00:24:23,986
What's going on?

245
00:24:25,312 --> 00:24:26,778
What about her blood pressure?

246
00:24:33,232 --> 00:24:35,848
What do you mean
her blood pressure has dropped?

247
00:24:35,848 --> 00:24:37,630
What's happening?

248
00:24:38,889 --> 00:24:40,130
I am sorry.

249
00:24:41,560 --> 00:24:43,992
We have done everything we possibly could.

250
00:24:43,992 --> 00:24:46,642
We are not sure whether
she can make it through the night.

251
00:24:54,104 --> 00:24:58,987
She will be in her room soon.

252
00:25:00,055 --> 00:25:04,291
Please prepare to say goodbye.

253
00:25:07,464 --> 00:25:08,755
What do you mean by goodbye?

254
00:25:10,007 --> 00:25:11,405
Goodbye to whom?

255
00:25:14,871 --> 00:25:16,026
I am sorry.

256
00:25:21,215 --> 00:25:22,355
Eun Seo.

257
00:25:27,793 --> 00:25:29,866
Mom.

258
00:25:31,344 --> 00:25:32,435
Mom.

259
00:26:07,321 --> 00:26:09,241
Eun Seo, Yoon Eun Seo.
She is your sister.

260
00:26:09,241 --> 00:26:10,403
Isn't she cute?

261
00:26:11,177 --> 00:26:13,265
Stay right here and wait for me.

262
00:26:13,265 --> 00:26:15,652
I will be right back. Good boy.

263
00:26:25,877 --> 00:26:27,869
- You idiot.
- Dad.

264
00:26:28,429 --> 00:26:30,765
Get in a hurry to leave for the U.S.

265
00:26:30,765 --> 00:26:34,519
Jun Seo being here is not helping Eun Seo.

266
00:26:35,132 --> 00:26:36,421
Honey.

267
00:26:36,421 --> 00:26:38,158
You don't deserve to meet Eun Seo.

268
00:26:42,471 --> 00:26:45,217
Eun Seo.

269
00:26:46,798 --> 00:26:50,274
I thought that would be
the best thing to do.

270
00:26:51,862 --> 00:26:56,335
I've always thought about
what would be the best for our family.

271
00:26:56,973 --> 00:27:00,431
I've always prioritized the best things
for everyone.

272
00:27:01,302 --> 00:27:06,401
So, I've ignored how hurt you've been,
how much you sacrificed...

273
00:27:06,401 --> 00:27:08,002
and everything you've been through.

274
00:27:09,064 --> 00:27:10,064
I'm sorry.

275
00:27:11,001 --> 00:27:12,155
I'm so sorry.

276
00:27:16,583 --> 00:27:17,590
Eun Seo.

277
00:27:18,743 --> 00:27:21,883
I can't even say "goodbye" to you.

278
00:27:22,704 --> 00:27:24,154
I can't do that.

279
00:27:25,839 --> 00:27:27,218
Please forgive me.

280
00:27:47,238 --> 00:27:49,385
You can't even push me away now.

281
00:27:58,031 --> 00:27:59,192
I'll bring him.

282
00:28:00,656 --> 00:28:02,056
I promise to bring him.

283
00:28:06,431 --> 00:28:08,042
So, wait for me.

284
00:29:07,799 --> 00:29:08,799
Let's go.

285
00:29:09,663 --> 00:29:11,097
Let's go. Eun Seo is waiting for you.

286
00:29:14,950 --> 00:29:16,523
Why are you doing this, Yoon Jun Seo?

287
00:29:20,271 --> 00:29:21,528
Look at me, Yoon Jun Seo.

288
00:29:24,119 --> 00:29:25,362
Jun Seo.

289
00:29:27,537 --> 00:29:29,245
Eun Seo is waiting for you.

290
00:29:30,817 --> 00:29:33,219
Let's go. Please.

291
00:29:40,763 --> 00:29:43,171
Are you really doing this?

292
00:29:43,171 --> 00:29:44,979
How can you do this to Eun Seo?

293
00:29:46,976 --> 00:29:47,976
Let's go.

294
00:29:49,642 --> 00:29:50,642
Get off of me.

295
00:29:51,186 --> 00:29:52,999
- Get off of me.
- Let's go.

296
00:29:58,918 --> 00:30:00,551
Get up and come with me.

297
00:30:00,551 --> 00:30:02,206
- Get off of me.
- Let's go.

298
00:30:02,206 --> 00:30:03,739
Get off of me.

299
00:30:09,877 --> 00:30:10,945
Yoon Jun Seo.

300
00:30:15,269 --> 00:30:16,784
Do you even know how I feel now?

301
00:30:18,487 --> 00:30:19,914
This is the only thing...

302
00:30:21,303 --> 00:30:23,769
All I can do is take you to Eun Seo.

303
00:30:26,030 --> 00:30:28,241
The one thing that was allowed
to me as love is...

304
00:30:32,294 --> 00:30:34,081
this thing here.

305
00:30:38,527 --> 00:30:40,952
What she wants is always you.

306
00:30:43,942 --> 00:30:45,599
Do you know how I feel?

307
00:30:47,740 --> 00:30:48,786
Do you?

308
00:30:56,629 --> 00:30:57,629
Tae Seok.

309
00:31:02,374 --> 00:31:04,467
Do you know...

310
00:31:06,705 --> 00:31:07,820
how I feel?

311
00:31:12,489 --> 00:31:13,987
If I come,

312
00:31:16,952 --> 00:31:19,123
I feel like she would be gone.

313
00:31:22,521 --> 00:31:24,582
What if she becomes relieved to see me...

314
00:31:28,938 --> 00:31:30,771
and then leaves?

315
00:31:34,265 --> 00:31:35,866
If I were not to come,

316
00:31:39,807 --> 00:31:41,778
would she keep waiting for me?

317
00:31:44,648 --> 00:31:46,202
If I wouldn't show up to her,

318
00:31:54,848 --> 00:31:57,585
would she live longer by waiting for me?

319
00:32:01,144 --> 00:32:02,764
Tae Seok, I'm scared.

320
00:32:07,567 --> 00:32:09,602
I'm scared to the point
of not knowing what to do.

321
00:33:24,757 --> 00:33:25,873
Eun Seo.

322
00:33:29,046 --> 00:33:30,218
Eun Seo.

323
00:33:33,909 --> 00:33:35,089
Eun Seo.

324
00:33:44,350 --> 00:33:45,752
Eun Seo, wake up.

325
00:33:48,607 --> 00:33:50,049
It's Jun Seo.

326
00:33:55,397 --> 00:33:57,653
I'm here.

327
00:33:57,653 --> 00:33:59,261
So please wake up.

328
00:34:02,941 --> 00:34:04,623
Even if waking up is...

329
00:34:09,852 --> 00:34:12,888
more painful than sleeping like this,

330
00:34:17,362 --> 00:34:19,003
please wake up for me.

331
00:34:25,538 --> 00:34:27,284
I'm selfish,

332
00:34:35,609 --> 00:34:38,044
but you always take me as I am.

333
00:34:44,465 --> 00:34:45,909
You always wait for me.

334
00:34:50,626 --> 00:34:52,360
You always forgive me.

335
00:34:56,790 --> 00:34:58,897
So, wake up, Eun Seo.

336
00:35:02,590 --> 00:35:04,151
Even if it hurts so much,

337
00:35:08,214 --> 00:35:09,914
wake up for me.

338
00:35:12,751 --> 00:35:13,751
I...

339
00:35:18,808 --> 00:35:20,644
want to eat with you,

340
00:35:23,009 --> 00:35:24,098
breathe with you,

341
00:35:26,008 --> 00:35:27,507
and talk with you.

342
00:35:32,192 --> 00:35:34,098
I want more time with you.

343
00:35:42,232 --> 00:35:44,306
I want to tell you I love you.

344
00:35:56,744 --> 00:35:58,538
Please don't take her away.

345
00:36:01,928 --> 00:36:03,595
Please hear my prayer, anyone up there.

346
00:36:05,743 --> 00:36:07,435
Please save my Eun Seo.

347
00:36:10,944 --> 00:36:13,218
Please allow us a little more time.

348
00:36:16,935 --> 00:36:18,204
A little more time.

349
00:36:20,391 --> 00:36:21,640
Please.

350
00:36:23,676 --> 00:36:24,905
Please.

351
00:37:05,585 --> 00:37:06,585
Jun Seo.

352
00:37:12,906 --> 00:37:14,083
Jun Seo.

353
00:37:18,776 --> 00:37:19,877
Jun Seo.

354
00:37:25,629 --> 00:37:26,629
Jun Seo.

355
00:37:35,780 --> 00:37:36,872
Jun Seo.

356
00:37:38,612 --> 00:37:39,767
Eun Seo.

357
00:37:50,892 --> 00:37:52,119
Have you slept well?

358
00:37:54,789 --> 00:37:59,583
I want to go home.

359
00:37:59,635 --> 00:38:00,662
Eun Seo.

360
00:39:06,425 --> 00:39:08,292
Eun Seo, we're home.

361
00:39:16,198 --> 00:39:17,227
Eun Seo.

362
00:39:18,391 --> 00:39:20,234
It's our first day.

363
00:39:28,105 --> 00:39:30,343
What do you mean Eun Seo is not here?

364
00:39:30,343 --> 00:39:33,757
Does it mean she woke up?

365
00:39:33,757 --> 00:39:34,982
Did she?

366
00:39:36,947 --> 00:39:41,503
I think she went out with Jun Seo
early in the morning.

367
00:39:48,725 --> 00:39:49,799
Thank you.

368
00:39:51,069 --> 00:39:52,368
Thank you.

369
00:39:54,637 --> 00:39:56,199
Thank you.

370
00:39:57,156 --> 00:39:58,220
Eun Seo.

371
00:39:59,525 --> 00:40:00,966
Eun Seo.

372
00:40:04,335 --> 00:40:05,449
Eun Seo.

373
00:40:07,232 --> 00:40:10,419
Then what do we do now?

374
00:40:11,096 --> 00:40:12,621
How will she be treated?

375
00:40:12,621 --> 00:40:16,975
We cannot do the bone marrow transplant,
since it is too late.

376
00:40:16,975 --> 00:40:20,735
So, I suggest that
she receives outpatient treatment.

377
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:07,616
Jun Seo.

378
00:42:09,012 --> 00:42:10,729
Do you have anything to tell me?

379
00:42:11,743 --> 00:42:15,106
What? Tell you what?

380
00:42:15,106 --> 00:42:16,157
Don't you have anything to say?

381
00:42:17,922 --> 00:42:19,189
I'm disappointed in you.

382
00:42:20,307 --> 00:42:22,212
You promised to tell me that.

383
00:42:24,516 --> 00:42:25,998
I'm not sure what that was.

384
00:42:26,643 --> 00:42:27,766
You say it first.

385
00:42:29,491 --> 00:42:30,491
No.

386
00:42:32,066 --> 00:42:33,669
Then you won't hear it from me.

387
00:42:35,204 --> 00:42:36,204
What?

388
00:42:38,987 --> 00:42:41,075
Okay, then.

389
00:42:41,075 --> 00:42:43,261
I can tell you that hundreds of times.

390
00:42:44,938 --> 00:42:46,261
I love you, Eun Seo.

391
00:42:54,577 --> 00:42:55,598
I love you.

392
00:43:51,071 --> 00:43:52,203
I'll be good.

393
00:43:53,280 --> 00:43:55,150
I'll be good to you.

394
00:43:55,150 --> 00:43:56,344
I will try.

395
00:44:09,509 --> 00:44:10,630
Will you marry me?

396
00:44:21,261 --> 00:44:23,022
Give me one more chance.

397
00:44:23,667 --> 00:44:26,960
No, I can't.

398
00:44:27,468 --> 00:44:30,023
How can I ask you to do that
after all this?

399
00:44:30,949 --> 00:44:31,949
I can't.

400
00:45:11,769 --> 00:45:12,988
Are you all right, Eun Seo?

401
00:45:14,200 --> 00:45:15,706
Jun Seo, go in.

402
00:45:15,706 --> 00:45:17,701
Go in, Jun Seo.

403
00:45:20,139 --> 00:45:21,139
Are you okay?

404
00:45:22,737 --> 00:45:23,860
Go, Jun Seo.

405
00:45:24,841 --> 00:45:27,922
Go in, Jun Seo.
I don't want you to see this.

406
00:45:27,922 --> 00:45:29,004
Go.

407
00:45:42,398 --> 00:45:43,553
Are you asleep, Eun Seo?

408
00:45:46,742 --> 00:45:47,742
Yes.

409
00:45:51,462 --> 00:45:52,691
Do you want to get more comfortable?

410
00:45:54,038 --> 00:45:55,038
No.

411
00:45:58,494 --> 00:46:00,496
I want to sleep like this.

412
00:46:02,334 --> 00:46:03,472
Can't I?

413
00:46:04,824 --> 00:46:09,055
Why not? Of course, you can.

414
00:46:13,808 --> 00:46:15,644
Tell me something, Jun Seo.

415
00:46:18,872 --> 00:46:21,108
I want to fall asleep listening to you.

416
00:46:29,401 --> 00:46:31,307
What should I tell you?

417
00:46:38,009 --> 00:46:42,580
Tell me what we're doing tomorrow.

418
00:46:48,082 --> 00:46:49,082
Tomorrow?

419
00:46:55,378 --> 00:46:59,756
First, I will wake up and clean up
for the first time in a long while.

420
00:47:02,978 --> 00:47:04,021
Clean up?

421
00:47:06,699 --> 00:47:09,147
I can't help you with that, then.

422
00:47:13,389 --> 00:47:15,380
You can do what you are good at.

423
00:47:16,161 --> 00:47:17,485
Rooting for me.

424
00:47:20,154 --> 00:47:23,157
Okay. I will.

425
00:47:27,137 --> 00:47:28,540
Then...

426
00:47:30,756 --> 00:47:33,661
I will go to the college
to meet with the professor.

427
00:47:34,914 --> 00:47:36,133
Don't take too long.

428
00:47:38,818 --> 00:47:39,871
Okay.

429
00:47:44,066 --> 00:47:47,134
What should we cook for lunch?

430
00:47:52,426 --> 00:47:54,094
We'll think about that tomorrow.

431
00:48:00,518 --> 00:48:01,793
Are you asleep, Eun Seo?

432
00:48:03,534 --> 00:48:04,534
Yes.

433
00:48:09,989 --> 00:48:13,223
Then I'll work on my project
in the afternoon,

434
00:48:15,068 --> 00:48:16,650
and you should get some rest.

435
00:48:18,453 --> 00:48:19,506
Will you?

436
00:48:23,560 --> 00:48:25,227
And then in the evening...

437
00:48:36,768 --> 00:48:37,828
Eun Seo.

438
00:48:50,368 --> 00:48:51,570
Eun Seo.

439
00:49:30,123 --> 00:49:31,285
Good night.

440
00:49:40,108 --> 00:49:41,813
See you tomorrow.

441
00:49:58,479 --> 00:49:59,967
Can you take a picture?

442
00:50:02,662 --> 00:50:04,284
Tae Seok.

443
00:50:04,284 --> 00:50:06,811
Why don't we take a picture
since you're here?

444
00:50:08,632 --> 00:50:11,972
From the beginning to the end,
my life is all about you.

445
00:50:11,972 --> 00:50:15,376
Promise me that
you won't think about dying, ever.

446
00:50:16,124 --> 00:50:20,721
How can I live without you?

447
00:50:31,948 --> 00:50:35,201
I'm very sick, aren't I?

448
00:50:35,741 --> 00:50:38,701
I won't let you go alone.
